+ *
+ * Throwaway (`README.md`). Names and descriptions follow each provider's real
+ * server (the addresses in `apps/web/server/hosted/integrations.ts`), cut to a
+ * believable set: GitHub's `x/all` toolsets are many, Granola's few. A row's
+ * "Connected · N tools" is the length of its list here, so the lengths are
+ * the counts the picture shows. Reads carry `readOnlyHint`, deletes
